      <xs:documentation source="WCO DM - IP_Introduction">
Meta Data

This document describes the WCO Data Model structure for the Meta Data. 
This information is always combined with one of the Information Packages to provide the necessary meta data.
Structure of Classes &amp; Attributes
This structure contains the hierarchical overview of all classes and attributes used for “Meta Data”. 
Separate columns are added for the GOVCBR (EDIFACT) path (whenever applicable) and the XML Tag Name. 

For further information on this technical structures you are referred to document “WCO DM V3.9.0_EDIFACT mapping_ccyymmdd” and to the XML Schema’s, which are all included in the published package.
The Unique Position ID is used to uniquely identify the attributes within the overall WCO Data Model structure.

UML Diagram
The zip file contains the UML Diagrams for the MetaData structure, see Section 3.2 (UmlDiagrams (html)).
