UN DMR to be raised for the following 1001 code:

11. Request by the WCO and US CBP to add four codes and descriptions to the UN/EDIFACT code list 3035 - Party function code qualifier:
* ?? - Co-principal - An additional party on a Customs bond that shares the responsibilities and obligations of the principal under the bond.
* ?? - Bond user - A party that benefits from being able to obligate a Customs bond but does not have the primary responsibility for fulfilling the bond's obligations.
* ?? - Co-surety - An additional surety company that shares the risk and responsibility with the primary surety in guaranteeing the obligations of the principal.

?? - Reinsurer - A company that provides reinsurance to the surety company that issued the Customs bond.
                        </xs:documentation>
